<Base title="Web App and Dashboard Development in Malaysia | SEOXpert" image={`/img/${pictures["web-app-development-malaysia"].file}.jpg`} description="Web app development in Malaysia: dashboards, logins and Stripe payment gateway set up with card, FPX and GrabPay, from the team that built XpertInsight." path="/web-app-development-malaysia/" crumb="Web app development" extraLd={[...extraLd, pf.ld]}>
<main id="main">
<PageHero kicker="Web app development" art="apps" crumb="Web app development" word="Apps">
  <Fragment slot="title">Web app and <em>dashboard</em> development in Malaysia.</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="lede">We build web apps for businesses: client dashboards, online tools, secure logins and Stripe payments by card, FPX or GrabPay. We already build and run our own, XpertInsight, XpertForesight and XpertStocks, and every project gets its own quote.</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="cta"><a class="btn" href="/contact/" data-track="get-a-quote">Get a quote</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#work">See what we have built</a></Fragment>
</PageHero>

<section class="solid band"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow rv">Web and app development</span>
  <h2 class="rv">What is web app development?</h2>
  <p class="sub rv">Web app development is building a website that people can use, not only read: they log in, see their own numbers, use a tool or pay. We do web application development for businesses in {areaText}, and every web app we build works in the browser on any phone, tablet or computer. If you were looking for a software development company in Malaysia for a dashboard, an online tool or a payment set up, this is what we do.</p>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:0"><div class="pet" style="--r:0deg"></div><h3>Client dashboards</h3><p>Your numbers in plain words, with charts, a date range to pick and PDF reports, like <a href="/website-report-dashboard/">XpertInsight</a>, the live dashboard our clients log in to.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:1"><div class="pet" style="--r:90deg"></div><h3>Online tools and calculators</h3><p>Free or paid tools for your customers, like the calculators on XpertStocks and the research tools in XpertForesight.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:2"><div class="pet" style="--r:180deg"></div><h3>Logins with one-time codes</h3><p>Members and clients log in with a fresh code sent to their email. There is no password to remember, reuse or leak.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:0"><div class="pet" style="--r:270deg"></div><h3>Payments and subscriptions</h3><p>Stripe payment gateway integration: one-time payments and payment links paid by card, FPX or GrabPay, and monthly or yearly plans that renew by card.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:1"><div class="pet" style="--r:45deg"></div><h3>Team and admin pages</h3><p>The side only your team sees: add and edit customers, send invites, read messages and change plans.</p></div>
    <div class="fcard rv" style="--d:2"><div class="pet" style="--r:135deg"></div><h3>Public pages that can be found</h3><p>The parts anyone can see are fast, static pages written for Google and AI search, built the way our <a href="/website-development/">website development</a> works.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

